                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Hardcore ZBoy isnt a funny game, it isnt unique, it isnt even a good looking game. Hardcore ZBoy is a failed attempt at a cash grab, it is patheticly awful and should NOT be on steam at all. This is the kind of game that can be made in unity in a few days max. It has glitches, it has bugs, it has awful physics, the random generation of the game means that 1 out of 5 times you will spawn inside a sign and die, other times your character wont turn and you will just hit the wall infront of you and die.\n\n\nIf, like me, you get a discount on this game and you want to test it, then please dont forget to refund it, this developer doesn't deserver any of your money.",
